{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"diagnosis\":\"The broad `grind` call cannot construct the matching transition for the shared right choice branch. Handle the two `ChoiceBisim` constructors and the `choiceL`/`choiceR` transition cases directly, using bisimilarity’s follow lemmas and reflexivity for the unchanged branch.\",\"proof_body\":\"by\\n  intro h\\n  use @ChoiceBisim _ _ defs, ChoiceBisim.choice h\\n  intro s₁ s₂ hs μ\\n  constructor\\n  · intro s₁' ht\\n    cases hs with\\n    | choice hb =>\\n      cases ht with\\n      | choiceL ht =>\\n        obtain ⟨q', ht', hb'⟩ := hb.follow_fst ht\\n        exact ⟨q', Tr.choiceL ht', ChoiceBisim.bisim hb'⟩\\n      | choiceR ht =>\\n        refine ⟨s₁', Tr.choiceR ht, ChoiceBisim.bisim ?_⟩\\n        apply HomBisimilarity.refl\\n    | bisim hb =>\\n      obtain ⟨q', ht', hb'⟩ := hb.follow_fst ht\\n      exact ⟨q', ht', ChoiceBisim.bisim hb'⟩\\n  · intro s₂' ht\\n    cases hs with\\n    | choice hb =>\\n      cases ht with\\n      | choiceL ht =>\\n        obtain ⟨p', ht', hb'⟩ := hb.follow_snd ht\\n        exact ⟨p', Tr.choiceL ht', ChoiceBisim.bisim hb'⟩\\n      | choiceR ht =>\\n        refine ⟨s₂', Tr.choiceR ht, ChoiceBisim.bisim ?_⟩\\n        apply HomBisimilarity.refl\\n    | bisim hb =>\\n      obtain ⟨p', ht', hb'⟩ := hb.follow_snd ht\\n      exact ⟨p', ht', ChoiceBisim.bisim hb'⟩\"}"}}
